  "why_refused": "Wright's figures in the western half of the run are about two millimetres of pen on a manuscript that was mounted on cloth to repair a tear, and the 600-dpi facsimile does not carry them: at 8x to 14x the cells hold a shape and not a number. 21 of the 35 are refused on that ground, lot 14 among them. Nothing is upgraded to make the run look complete.",
